Original ResTable_config selection methods and LocaleData/LocaleDataTables from
android-13.0.0_r1 are compiled to standalone WebAssembly. Original function
bodies and data are retained; the wrapper supplies only fixed memory slots and
exports. Source excerpts are generated deterministically from the pinned complete
upstream files. No Linux, Android process, filesystem or network imports exist
in the resulting Wasm module. This is resource selection, not a full Android OS.

Emscripten 3.1.74 supplies compiler support, libc (musl), and libc++ runtime.
Respective license notices are in licenses/. ICU-derived locale tables are
retained from AOSP LocaleDataTables.cpp; corresponding Unicode/ICU notice is
provided alongside the AOSP source archive.
